00:00:04.820 --> 00:00:07.606
My one word is believe
and I believe in people

00:00:07.606 --> 00:00:09.403
more than they believe in themselves

00:00:09.403 --> 00:00:12.776
and my sincere hope is
that if you see in yourself

00:00:12.776 --> 00:00:16.319
what I see in you, you'll be
able to change the planet.

00:00:16.319 --> 00:00:18.265
I started the Believe
Life series to help us

00:00:18.265 --> 00:00:21.535
learn a little bit more about
ourselves, grow personally

00:00:21.535 --> 00:00:24.264
and ideally bring some of
what we learn about ourselves

00:00:24.264 --> 00:00:26.588
to our business to have more success.

00:00:26.588 --> 00:00:29.612
So today we're going to
learn how to take risks.

00:00:29.612 --> 00:00:32.101
Rule number three is my
personal favorite and I'd love

00:00:32.101 --> 00:00:34.025
to know which one you guys like the best.

00:00:34.025 --> 00:00:35.735
Also as you're watching,
if you hear something

